{"text": "That is very interesting, said the policeman, Have you heard from your friend since then. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Well, we wrote to each other for a while, but after a year or two we lost touch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The West is a very big place, and I was always moving around quickly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But I know that Jimmy will meet me here if he is still alive. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was always the truest, most loyal friend in the world, and he will never forget. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The waiting man took out a fine watch whose lids were set with small diamonds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is three minutes to ten, he said, We parted here at ten oclock exactly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I guess you did pretty well in the West, said the policeman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I sure did, I hope Jimmy has done half as well, but he was a kind of plodder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I had to fight against the sharpest minds to get my money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The policeman twirled his club and said, Well, I will be on my way, I hope your friend comes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will give him half an hour at least, said the man, and the policeman walked on.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "i", "n", "t", "e", "r", "e", "s", "t", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "o", "l", "i", "c", "e", "m", "a", "n", ",", " ", "H", "a", "v", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "h", "e", "a", "r", "d", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "f", "r", "i", "e", "n", "d", " ", "s", "i", "n", "c", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "e", "l", "l", ",", " ", "w", "e", " ", "w", "r", "o", "t", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "e", "a", "c", "h", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "a", " ", "w", "h", "i", "l", "e", ",", " ", "b", "u"